  "_id": "6ad492247c2d0ac7ec06e469",
  "title": "Odoo to go",
  "slug": "odoo-to-go",
  "summary": "A mobile interface for browsing and editing Odoo records through XML-RPC.",
  "content": "<p>I explored a mobile interface for Odoo Community and Enterprise, using XML-RPC to load modules and their records from an Odoo server.</p><h3>Working with business data</h3><p>The app presents records in lists, supports searching within modules, editing record contents and deleting individual entries. It also loads module submenus.</p><p>An iOS widget provides a shortcut for creating contacts. A Kanban view was still in development in the earlier project documentation and is not presented here as a completed feature.</p>",
